'''Goddess Beam''' is a [[debuff]] from the skill of the same name. It is applied by map bosses [[The Goddess]] or [[Vision of Justice]]. Similar to [[Shock and Horror]]'s [[Lightning Beam]], the beam is "namelocked" to the player's character so that the character need to hide behind the columns in the boss arena to break the "namelock". The datamined fire [[damage over time|DOT]] value is 2045.8 per second (and before reduced by fire resistance which normally all players are at least capped it at 75%), but monster use different scaling so that the damage may be even bigger when in red map and with certain map mod. Alternatively, {{il|Righteous Fire}} build or similar, may have high enough regen to counter the degen from this debuff.
